Description: 
    Tools to support Self-Referenced Trajectory Modelling (SRTM) for 
    educational and behavioural data. The package includes utilities for 
    generating synthetic longitudinal datasets, modelling individual change 
    trajectories, and preparing data for downstream analyses. Functions follow 
    tidyverse conventions and provide reproducible pipelines for simulating 
    baseline scores, heterogeneous slopes, growth effects, and trajectory 
    perturbations. Synthetic data generation includes group-based initialisation, 
    heteroscedastic noise, and flexible intervention effects for method 
    development, testing, and demonstration.
